                <UserObject event_date="1817-03-25" event_end_date="1817-06-24" date_label="25 March-24 June 1817" location="Halifax (pay-list heading)" name_as_recorded="Leven Demell" evidence_type="Named pay-list entry" source_shape_ids="[&quot;volume15&quot;, &quot;lead-voucher6&quot;]" source_files="[&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7089/P1070532.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7089/P1070533.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7089/P1070534.JPG&quot;]" link="primary_sources/WO_12-7089/P1070532.JPG" citation="Heading for March-June 1817; named entry 136; footnote explaining the transfer marks. Exact individual transfer date is not established." label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;25 March-24 June 1817&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Halifax (pay-list heading)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;Leven Demell&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Listed in the 7th Battalion&amp;#x27;s final quarter. His transfer mark refers to men subsequently charged in the 3rd Battalion under return voucher 6.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Named pay-list entry &amp;middot; &lt;a href=&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7089/P1070532.JPG&quot;&gt;WO 12/7089 / WO 12/7009: voucher 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Heading for March-June 1817; named entry 136; footnote explaining the transfer marks. Exact individual transfer date is not established.&#xa;&#xa;Supporting files:&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7089/P1070532.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7089/P1070533.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7089/P1070534.JPG" id="event-transfer-out">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=15;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacing=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3F3F3F;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry height="240" width="320" x="6432.47360322303" y="-1864" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </UserObject>
                <UserObject event_date="1817-06-25" event_end_date="1817-09-24" date_label="25 June-24 Sep 1817" location="Annapolis (entry); Halifax (unit)" name_as_recorded="Demel, Louis" evidence_type="Named pay-list entry" source_shape_ids="[&quot;volume17&quot;, &quot;lead-voucher6&quot;]" source_files="[&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070627.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070625.JPG&quot;]" link="primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070627.JPG" citation="Entry 124, company 10, and quarter heading. Identification as the same man is supported by the transfer annotation and Ruth&#39;s 6 August 2019 report." label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;25 June-24 Sep 1817&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Annapolis (entry); Halifax (unit)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;Demel, Louis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Listed in Company 10 of the 3rd Battalion, 60th Foot, with the remark &amp;quot;from 7th Batt.&amp;quot; The entry gives Annapolis for the muster locations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Named pay-list entry &amp;middot; &lt;a href=&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070627.JPG&quot;&gt;WO 12/7009 / WO 12/7009: voucher 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Entry 124, company 10, and quarter heading. Identification as the same man is supported by the transfer annotation and Ruth&#39;s 6 August 2019 report.&#xa;&#xa;Supporting files:&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070627.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070625.JPG" id="event-transfer-in">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=15;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacing=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3F3F3F;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry height="240" width="320" x="6800.2224235312515" y="-1850" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </UserObject>
                <UserObject event_date="1818-07-25" event_end_date="1818-07-25" date_label="25 July 1818" location="&quot;In this Country&quot;; Halifax unit heading" name_as_recorded="Demel, Louis" evidence_type="Entry and researcher reading" source_shape_ids="[&quot;volume17&quot;]" source_files="[&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070639.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070640.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070636.JPG&quot;, &quot;research_notes/Gmail - Update.pdf&quot;]" link="primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070639.JPG" citation="Named row and continuation photograph; Ruth Bloom, 6 August 2019, Update.pdf page 1, supplies the reading 25 July. An exact discharge town is not asserted." label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;25 July 1818&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;In this Country&amp;quot;; Halifax unit heading&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;Demel, Louis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Entry 130 is struck through and marked discharged. Pay runs through 24 July; Ruth reads the discharge date as 25 July. The destination column says &amp;quot;in this Country.&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Entry and researcher reading &amp;middot; &lt;a href=&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070639.JPG&quot;&gt;WO 12/7009&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Named row and continuation photograph; Ruth Bloom, 6 August 2019, Update.pdf page 1, supplies the reading 25 July. An exact discharge town is not asserted.&#xa;&#xa;Supporting files:&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070639.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070640.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070636.JPG&#xa;research_notes/Gmail - Update.pdf" id="event-discharge">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=15;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacing=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3F3F3F;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry height="240" width="320" x="7167.998228115466" y="-1830" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </UserObject>
                <UserObject event_date="1821-02-20" event_end_date="1821-02-20" date_label="20 February 1821" location="Sherbrook / Chester (residences)" name_as_recorded="Liven Demal" evidence_type="Reported diary entry" source_shape_ids="[&quot;lead-first-marriage&quot;]" source_files="[&quot;research_notes/Notes- Marriage info Levi Dimmell.docx&quot;]" link="research_notes/Notes- Marriage info Levi Dimmell.docx" citation="Walter DeMelle&#39;s notes, section 3, from his 2003 Nova Scotia research: The Diary and Related Writings of the Reverend Joseph Dimock (1768-1846), page 123. Spelling follows the cited diary reading, not a harmonised family name." label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;20 February 1821&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sherbrook / Chester (residences)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;Liven Demal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Walter cites Dimock&amp;#x27;s diary, page 123: marriage to Elizabeth Refus of Chester; Liven Demal is described as of Sherbrook. The ceremony location is not established by the note.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Reported diary entry &amp;middot; &lt;a href=&quot;research_notes/Notes- Marriage info Levi Dimmell.docx&quot;&gt;Dimock diary, p. 123 (cited)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Walter DeMelle&#39;s notes, section 3, from his 2003 Nova Scotia research: The Diary and Related Writings of the Reverend Joseph Dimock (1768-1846), page 123. Spelling follows the cited diary reading, not a harmonised family name.&#xa;&#xa;Supporting files:&#xa;research_notes/Notes- Marriage info Levi Dimmell.docx" id="event-first-marriage">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=15;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacing=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3F3F3F;" vertex="1">
