                <UserObject event_date="1817-06-25" event_end_date="1817-09-24" date_label="25 June-24 Sep 1817" location="Annapolis (entry); Halifax (unit)" name_as_recorded="Demel, Louis" evidence_type="Named pay-list entry" source_shape_ids="[&quot;volume17&quot;, &quot;lead-voucher6&quot;]" source_files="[&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070627.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070625.JPG&quot;]" link="primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070627.JPG" citation="Entry 124, company 10, and quarter heading. Identification as the same man is supported by the transfer annotation and Ruth&#39;s 6 August 2019 report." label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;25 June-24 Sep 1817&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Annapolis (entry); Halifax (unit)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;Demel, Louis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Listed in Company 10 of the 3rd Battalion, 60th Foot, with the remark &quot;from 7th Batt.&quot; The entry gives Annapolis for the muster locations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Named pay-list entry · &lt;a href=&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070627.JPG&quot;&gt;WO 12/7009 / WO 12/7009: voucher 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Entry 124, company 10, and quarter heading. Identification as the same man is supported by the transfer annotation and Ruth&#39;s 6 August 2019 report.&#xa;&#xa;Supporting files:&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070627.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7009/P1070625.JPG" id="2zcWGtw5zmKfbrun1eY2-57">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=15;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacing=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3F3F3F;" vertex="1">
